  "cards":[
    {"id":"strict-plan","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"concept-strict-retrieval-plan","question":"RetrievalPlan允许哪些字段？","aliases":["检索路由模型能输出什么"],"keywords":["RetrievalPlan","字段","检索路由模型"],"diagnostic":"检查策略、k、预算、白名单过滤和改写。","hints":["查看 #concept-strict-retrieval-plan。","未知字段立即拒绝。"],"example":"strategy,lexical_k,vector_k,filters。","answer":"只允许固定策略、各路k、最大候选、白名单filters和有界rewrites。","source":{"label":"严格检索计划","href":"#concept-strict-retrieval-plan"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"no-model-sql","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"concept-strict-retrieval-plan","question":"为什么不能让模型直接生成检索SQL？","aliases":["模型输出raw_sql安全吗"],"keywords":["模型","检索SQL","raw_sql","安全"],"diagnostic":"检查计划是否映射到预定义参数化查询。","hints":["查看 #concept-strict-retrieval-plan。","模型没有数据库连接。"],"example":"raw_sql过滤字段被拒绝。","answer":"模型输出不可信，任意SQL会绕过ACL和预算；应用只能执行白名单参数化查询。","source":{"label":"严格检索计划","href":"#concept-strict-retrieval-plan"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"lexical-route","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"concept-route-and-budget","question":"哪些查询优先走关键词检索？","aliases":["错误码和课程ID用向量合适吗"],"keywords":["关键词检索","错误码","课程ID","向量"],"diagnostic":"识别精确标识和稀有术语。","hints":["查看 #concept-route-and-budget。","精确词面优先lexical。"],"example":"HTTP-404。","answer":"课程ID、错误码、版本号和精确术语优先lexical。","source":{"label":"路由与预算","href":"#concept-route-and-budget"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"hybrid-route","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"concept-route-and-budget","question":"自然语言问题为什么适合混合检索？","aliases":["什么时候同时跑BM25和vector"],"keywords":["自然语言问题","混合检索","BM25","vector"],"diagnostic":"检查词面与同义召回是否互补。","hints":["查看 #concept-route-and-budget。","融合前各路都要限额。"],"example":"hybrid lexical 8 vector 8。","answer":"关键词保留精确词面，向量补同义表达；两路有界后再RRF融合。","source":{"label":"路由与预算","href":"#concept-route-and-budget"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"bounded-decompose","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"concept-route-and-budget","question":"问题分解为什么要限制子查询数？","aliases":["复杂问题能无限拆分吗"],"keywords":["问题分解","限制","子查询数","无限拆分"],"diagnostic":"检查最大三条和总候选预算。","hints":["查看 #concept-route-and-budget。","每个子查询也消耗预算。"],"example":"rewrites<=3。","answer":"无限拆分会放大延迟、成本和候选噪声；本课最多三条。","source":{"label":"路由与预算","href":"#concept-route-and-budget"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"acl-first","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"example-acl-first-pipeline","question":"ACL应该在检索哪一步执行？","aliases":["召回后过滤权限可以吗"],"keywords":["ACL","检索","召回后","过滤权限"],"diagnostic":"检查私有内容是否曾进入候选。","hints":["查看 #example-acl-first-pipeline。","subject和metadata先过滤。"],"example":"private-other-owner:0。","answer":"在关键词和向量召回前执行，未授权内容从不进入候选。","source":{"label":"ACL前置流水线","href":"#example-acl-first-pipeline"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"rrf-purpose","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"concept-route-and-budget","question":"RRF怎样融合多路排名？","aliases":["为什么RRF不用直接比较分数"],"keywords":["RRF","融合","多路排名","比较分数"],"diagnostic":"检查是否按名次贡献而非异构原始分。","hints":["查看 #concept-route-and-budget。","同chunk贡献累加。"],"example":"1/(k+rank)。","answer":"RRF按每路名次累加倒数贡献，避免直接比较BM25与向量的异构分数。","source":{"label":"路由与预算","href":"#concept-route-and-budget"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"dedupe-parent","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"troubleshoot-retrieval-router","question":"父子召回为什么还要按parent去重？","aliases":["多个child会挤满上下文吗"],"keywords":["父子召回","parent去重","child","上下文"],"diagnostic":"检查同一parent的多个child占位。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-retrieval-router。","先保留最佳child再回填。"],"example":"parent_ids唯一。","answer":"多个child可能来自同一父段，不去重会让同一内容挤满候选和上下文。","source":{"label":"检索路由排错","href":"#troubleshoot-retrieval-router"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"candidate-stages","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"overview-retrieval-routing","question":"候选预算要记录哪些阶段？","aliases":["只看最终TopK够吗"],"keywords":["候选预算","阶段","最终TopK"],"diagnostic":"检查授权、分路、融合和父块计数。","hints":["查看 #overview-retrieval-routing。","记录每层输入输出。"],"example":"authorized/lexical/vector/fused。","answer":"记录授权后、各召回路、RRF去重和最终parent/context候选数。","source":{"label":"检索路由闭环","href":"#overview-retrieval-routing"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"safe-time-filter","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-04","context_id":"modify-add-time-filter","question":"时间过滤怎样安全加入检索？","aliases":["updated_after能直接拼SQL吗"],"keywords":["时间过滤","安全","updated_after","拼SQL"],"diagnostic":"检查ISO解析、白名单和参数化。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-time-filter。","ACL保持同一查询。"],"example":"服务端参数化日期。","answer":"把ISO日期加入严格Schema，服务端解析并参数化执行，不能拼SQL表达式。","source":{"label":"增加时间过滤","href":"#modify-add-time-filter"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
